{"data":[{"slug":"fmea-moderator-consutant-vda-mehr-norderstedt-259004","company_name":"QMH Consulting GmbH","title":"FMEA Moderator/ Consutant (m/w/d) - VDA & mehr","description":"<p>QMH Consulting unterstützt Unternehmen aus Automotive, MedTech, Maschinenbau und Elektronik dabei, FMEA normkonform, auditfest und praxistauglich in ihre Prozesse zu integrieren.</p><p>Dafür suchen wir eine/-n FMEA-Moderator / Consultant (m/w/d), der/die Projekte methodensicher führt, Teams strukturiert durch die 7 Schritte leitet und Ergebnisse schafft, die Audits bestehen und im Alltag wirken.</p><h2>Aufgaben</h2><p><strong>Aufgaben</strong></p><ul><li><p>Moderation von Design- und Prozess-FMEA nach AIAG/VDA in Entwicklungs- und Serienprojekten</p></li><li><p>Strukturierung und Durchführung der 7 Schritte inkl. Funktions-, Fehler-, Risiko- und Maßnahmenanalyse</p></li><li><p>Dokumentation in APIS, PLATO oder kundenspezifischen Tools; Pflege von Struktur- und Netzansichten</p></li><li><p>FMEA-Reviews: Plausibilitäts-, Vollständigkeits- und Wirksamkeitschecks; Ableitung von Verbesserungen</p></li><li><p>FMEA-Prozessaufbau: Rollen, Templates, Timings, Schnittstellen (APQP, Control Plan, SPC)</p></li><li><p>Training & Coaching von Fachabteilungen bis zur Moderatorenqualifikation</p></li><li><p>Vorbereitung auf Kunden-/Auditorenanforderungen (z. B. VDA 6.3) und Unterstützung bei Freigaben</p></li><li><p>Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Entwicklung, Qualität, Produktion, Lieferanten und Projektleitung</p></li></ul><h2>Qualifikation</h2><p><strong>Qualifikation</strong></p><ul><li><p>Technisches Studium oder vergleichbare Qualifikation (z. B. Techniker:in/Meister:in)</p></li><li><p>Praxis in FMEA-Moderation (D-/P-FMEA) nach AIAG/VDA – idealerweise in Automotive oder regulierten Branchen</p></li><li><p>Sicherer Umgang mit APIS oder PLATO (alternativ schnelle Auffassungsgabe für neue Tools)</p></li><li><p>Erfahrung in Prozess-/Produktentwicklung, Qualität oder Produktion</p></li><li><p>Methodensicherheit, klare Kommunikation und stringente Moderation heterogener Teams</p></li><li><p>Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse; Reisebereitschaft für Workshops beim Kunden (nach Bedarf)</p></li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><ul><li><p>Überdurchschnittliche Vergütung und attraktive Zusatzleistungen</p></li><li><p>Flexible Arbeitszeiten, 100 % Remote möglich, klare Prozesse</p></li><li><p>Unbefristeter Vertrag und strukturierte Einarbeitung</p></li><li><p>Projekte mit Substanz bei OEMs, Tier-1 und Mittelstand</p></li><li><p>Viel Gestaltungsspielraum: Prozessaufbau, Templates, Guidelines, Tool-Einführung</p></li><li><p>Kollegiales Team, flache Hierarchien und direkter Draht zur Geschäftsführung</p></li></ul><p>Klingt passend? Dann bewirb dich direkt über den Button auf dieser Seite!<br>Wir freuen uns auf dich – mit Methodensicherheit, Pragmatismus und Spaß an wirksamer Qualität.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/qmh-consulting-gmbh/fmea-moderator-consutant-vda-mehr-norderstedt-259004","tags":["Quality Management"],"job_types":["Unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag"],"location":"Norderstedt","created_at":1794036651},{"slug":"strategic-account-executive-dach-186831","company_name":"Axon","title":"Strategic Account Executive, DACH","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axon Account Executives are responsible for selling Axon products and services to large and complex Law Enforcement and Public Safety agencies. This is a quota carrying, external field position. Ability to articulate complex solutions, build and maintain senior level relationships, navigate across customer agencies / units, and lead the Axon team to success is required. The position provides technical and administrative product information, demonstrations, and/or product training. You will take charge of a significant proportion of customers and engage in significant complex sales opportunities, often of 7- and 8-digit value. Your success will be built on exceptional relationship building at both operational and board-equivalent levels both externally and internally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, our goal is to make each individual feel valued for his or her contributions to the company’s mission to protect life. We are looking for intelligent people who want to do remarkable things. We strive to create an environment where people can succeed and enjoy coming to work every day. Life at Axon is fast paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. You will constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow revenue and market share at designated agencies to maximize customer satisfaction and achieve Axon’s strategic objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain client relationships to ultimately drive revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute account strategy by collaborating with account team to deliver stronger, more relevant value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate customer relationships and ensure effective service delivery to accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on customer&#39;s satisfaction, know the customer&#39;s business and workflows, develop proper contact network within accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support execution of strategy at the account level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with and bring in experts/specialists where required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee all account activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for forecasting, keep management in touch with accounts in a timely fashion, gather intelligence on competitor activity, and give feedback to marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track customer activity in internal systems in order to execute on account strategy and identify additional opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May provide customer product training as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for individual expense budget management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own account relationship and drive overall customer satisfaction for assigned accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You Bring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel up to 70%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An extensive demonstrable track record in Software Sales (SaaS / Cloud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship / consultative selling experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to clearly and directly articulate complex solution offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data management experience using Salesforce or similar CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtualization and Cloud understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Player - collaborate with various team members regularly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to own &amp;amp; drive the territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup experience &amp;amp; some vertical experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defense / Law Enforcement / Public Safety experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
