&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;markdown-document&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;The Senior Director, Sales — DACH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;47&quot;&gt; is a senior first-line sales leadership role responsible for building and driving a high-performing team of Strategic Account Executives focused on net-new logo acquisition and expansion across enterprise accounts in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland (DACH). This leader owns a significant ARR target and is accountable for the full sales cycle — from pipeline creation through close — within the DACH region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;456&quot;&gt;This is a high-visibility, high-impact role that sits at the intersection of enterprise sales leadership and DACH market GTM strategy. You will translate Talkdesk’s business objectives into a regional execution plan, serve as a brand ambassador for the Talkdesk CX platform, and partner closely with Marketing, Product, Channel, and Customer Success to drive durable growth across this strategic European market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;871&quot;&gt;DUTIES &amp;amp; RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
