 We are backed with more than $200M from Peter Thiel's Valar Ventures, Tiger Global, Hummingbird, QED, Creandum, and the founders of Nubank, Ramp, Deel, Circle, Fluidstack, Fuse, and Etched.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />We are regulated in Europe and live with Euro and Stablecoin clearing today. Now, we are building the US team from the ground up, while continuing to grow rapidly in Europe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The Role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a 4-month program: 3 months in Berlin, 1 month in New York. You’ll join one of our tracks (CEO Office, Growth, Product, Ops or Talent) and own real work from day one. Like everyone at Augustus, you’ll run day-to-day work in parallel with one or two larger projects.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />Recent projects run by interns:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rebuilt our talent engine and cut time-to-fill from 82 days to 34.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Took a new product from first customer call to production launch.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relaunched our CRM to drive data accuracy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Built the sales case behind our largest deals.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Who Will Thrive At Augustus</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe that throwing smart people with high agency at big problems produces the best outcomes. We’re building a modern correspondent bank, and we win by having a better team. The people who succeed here share the following traits:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>American Dream:</strong> You’d rather shoot for gold than settle for mediocrity. You pick the harder goal and stay optimistic when the odds are against you. If it feels easy, we aimed too low.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Live Player:</strong> You don’t need permission. You rebuild what’s broken wi