al, or consulting and/or you have demonstrated initiative through side projects, student organizations, research, or entrepreneurial experiences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are available for 4 months.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Based in Berlin or willing to relocate.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What You Get</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who you'll learn from: </strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Every intern is mentored by a founder or executive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A peer buddy for day-to-day questions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A 1:1 with one of our VC investors or angels.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your setup:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A dedicated stipend covering unlimited AI token usage for your work.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What comes after:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exceed our expectations and you can convert to full-time, or stay on as a working student.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What We Offer</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Career Growth:</strong> You will be given more responsibility and pushed to grow faster than ever before.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Network:</strong> Your peers are brilliant, highly motivated people. These people will be foundational in your future opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real Participation:</strong> Employees are shareholders. You will think and act like an owner.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Perks &amp; Benefits:</strong> Relocation support, visa support, the latest Apple gear (MacBook + AirPods), lunch benefit, gym benefit