esponse rates, conversion by stage, time to fill and offer declines in our ATS, keep the data clean, and use it to show hiring managers where a search is stuck and what to change.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hiring Quality &amp; Manager Accountability:</strong> Run and improve our structured interviews, scorecards and debriefs, and hold hiring managers to the standards we agreed on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Recruiting Productivity &amp; AI:</strong> Test automation and AI to save time on sourcing, screening prep and candidate communication. Measure time saved and quality kept, not the number of tools deployed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Candidate Experience &amp; Employer Brand:</strong> Make every candidate journey sharp and human, from first message to offer, and help leadership and marketing grow ScorePlay’s visibility as an employer.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>Key Requirements</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experience</strong>: 4+ years in talent acquisition or sourcing, ideally in fast-scaling tech companies. Technical hiring experience is a big plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sourcing Expertise</strong>: Proven ability to identify and engage niche talent, with a track record of successful outreach and conversions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data-Driven Recruiting</strong>: Comfortable using funnel metrics (conversion, time to fill, offer acceptance) to diagnose issues and influence hiring managers’ decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Structured Hiring</strong>: Experience running structured interviews and scorecards, and holding hiring managers to agreed standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builder Mindset &amp; AI</strong>: Curious and hands-on with AI and automation. You try new ways of working and keep what actually makes you faster or better.</