fully implement existing standards and processes while contributing your own ideas (coordinating vehicle returns, handovers, and vehicle preparation)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collaboration with roadsurfer Stations</strong>: You maintain constant communication with all international teams to ensure ongoing improvements</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Team Leadership</strong>: As a Team Leader, you motivate and lead your on-site team. This includes onboarding, effective task planning, and quality control</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Recruitment</strong>: You have control over building your team and seek the right talent for your location</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fleet Management:</strong> You always have an overview of the local vehicle fleet for rental and sales: documentation, maintenance, cleanliness, and coordination with local service partners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer Consultation</strong>: You advise customers on our products, myroadsurfer, abo, spots, and rent, and send them out as happy roadsurfers on the roads of Europe</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you need to surf the wave with us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Successfully completed training or studies in a relevant subject area or comparable qualification</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 1-2 years of relevant work experience, preferably in areas such as car rental, tourism, or similar - career changers are welcome </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in leading employees or teams is advantageous </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High service and customer orientation with a friendly and open demeanor</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are a hands-on and effective communicator</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You ar