ities and high-quality delivery standards</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Facilitate data-driven decision-making for leadership through weekly cadences, steering committee prep, and risk dashboards.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Strategic Scoping &amp; Value Definition</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop a deep understanding of the client’s business, operating model, and strategic priorities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with the Program Lead and Account team to scope transformative programs, identify and define use cases, and build a clear business case and value framework</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate strategic ambition into measurable outcomes and track the long-term business impact of each program</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Delivery &amp; Execution</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own delivery frameworks: timelines, milestones, reporting, proactively securing commitments and flagging risks or delays early.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Optimize delivery processes by identifying friction points and standardizing workflows to enhance quality and predictability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run the account's logistics for Mistral team going on site (access, security, meetings) </p></li></ul><h3><strong>Operational Innovation &amp; Automation</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and enhance Mistral’s platform and internal tools to empower program delivery with scalable, tailored solutions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automate workflows to eliminate manual friction in planning, reporting, and follow-ups, accelerating execution and reducing operational overhead</p></li></ul><h2><strong><br />Who you are</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical foundation.</strong> You have an engineering or equivalent technical backgroun