&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/datadog/manager-i-engineering-client-sdks-mobile-browser-paris-39066","tags":["Leadership"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1794023718},{"slug":"marketing-manager-boulogne-billancourt-hauts-de-seine-463392","company_name":"Verifone","title":"Marketing Manager","description":"&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re searching a &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to execute Verifone’s marketing strategy in France and play a pivotal role in accelerating our growth in one of Europe’s most dynamic payments markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Marketing Manager, you’ll be the engine behind France’s marketing performance: building the systems, dashboards, and processes that power smarter decisions, stronger campaigns, and measurable commercial impact. You’ll lead both day‑to‑day execution and long‑term strategy, ensuring our brand, messaging, and demand generation efforts land with precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the full marketing funnel - from awareness and acquisition to retention and installed‑base growth and you’ll bring hands‑on expertise in marketing automation, lead nurturing, and multi‑channel campaign orchestration. Email, digital, content, events… you know how to blend them into high‑performing programs that generate qualified leads and fuel sales momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries clear accountability: hitting France’s lead targets, elevating lead quality and conversion, enriching data, automating processes, and delivering sharp reporting across programs and channels. Your work will directly influence pipeline, performance, and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, manage and implement marketing programs and strategies for Verifone France and Paybox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and update the Verifone Regional websites (Including Paybox): website maintenance, supervising the creation and development of websites, including creating specification documents to improve the website and other online projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the advertising campaigns and the relationship with the agency, including creating lists of keywords that define campaigns, creating and testing ads/banners specific for targeted verticals, set-up and monitor end to end lead tracking (sources/channels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess about results: analyze site traffic and website flows, conversion optimization campaign results, analyze and report program performance; report metrics appropriately and flag issues for internal stakeholders, provide recommendations for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose new marketing strategies and implement new ideas that can improve overall funnel performance, from brand awareness to client retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage email nurture flows and/or drip programs for both prospects and existing customers to support sales growth and retention, and implement the tracking of these flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple teams for developing an effective strategy and new programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native French speaker with advanced English proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, or a related field, with strong foundations in modern digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading integrated, multi‑channel marketing campaigns across digital, content, email, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on mastery of key platforms, including &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=Explain_marketing_automation_tools&quot;&gt;marketing automation tools&lt;/span&gt; (Pardot, Marketo, etc.), &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=What_is_a_CRM_and_how_is_it_used&quot;&gt;CRMs&lt;/span&gt; such as Salesforce or Pipedrive, Google Analytics, social platforms (Facebook, Instagram), and email marketing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical capability to manage complex lead lifecycles, optimize funnel performance, and extract insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills to coordinate cross‑functional initiatives and deliver high‑impact marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up‑to‑date knowledge of industry trends, emerging technologies, and modern marketing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEM‑focused copywriting skills to craft compelling, conversion‑driven search content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML for landing page and email optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert‑level Excel skills, including large dataset handling and macro‑based automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in suggesting new concepts/ideas, self-motivated, fast learner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented and problem-solving attitude (use analytical and creative thinking to find solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented, great attention to detail, openness to testing and analyzing large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: ability to cooperate and work fairly with others, at all levels, within and outside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and work under tight deadlines when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/verifone/marketing-manager-boulogne-billancourt-hauts-de-seine-463392","tags":["Global Marketing"],"job_types":[],"location":"Boulogne-Billancourt, Hauts-de-Seine","created_at":1794023717},{"slug":"engineer-i-field-service-217403","company_name":"Asm","title":"Engineer I, Field Service","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain tool uptime and ensure excellent execution of installation and support of hardware issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain, and ensure the relevance of technical information used by internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and build long-term innovative global technology systems that enable enhanced customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure communication vehicles, e.g. telephone, email, and presentation, etc. are able to facilitate efficient and consistent customer follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement of the customer experience through team, hardware, software, and support tool development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and manage new product installs and subsequent hardware development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects manage new evaluations and ensure the success of the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional assigned tasks when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business travel is required when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in building collaborative partnerships with customers and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a team environment with tight deadlines and multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English language fluency is required as you will be working with international clients and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/asm/engineer-i-field-service-217403","tags":["SU1.BU3.Sales & Services Europe"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794023715},{"slug":"chief-of-staff-intern-paris-416936","company_name":"Finary","title":"Chief of Staff Intern","description":"<h3>What is Finary?</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Money is broken. Most people's wealth sits in products they did not choose, with fees they cannot see, and a private banker costs more than they will ever pay. We are putting one in everyone's pocket: the same quality of advice for a €10K saver and a €10M client.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mounirlaggoune/">Mounir</a> launched Finary in 2021, and more than 1M people now track their wealth with us, for free. Finary AI turns that financial context into a plan, and our own investment products and in-house wealth advisors (Finary One) make it real: clarity on what you have, guidance on where you are going, action to get there.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>Why now?</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI makes this vision possible, and 3 things make it hard to copy:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data:</strong> years of per-user financial history, goals and risk profiles that no public dataset holds.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Brand:</strong> half of our new users come from our own channels, and 1 signup in 5 names our YouTube channel.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Licences:</strong> stocks, ETFs and crypto on one regulated platform, passportable across Europe. We started early, when a simple registration was enough: PSAN in 2022, Investment Firm licence in March 2026, MiCA in July 2026. Since July, every crypto platform in Europe must be licensed or stop.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Many fintechs will have the AI, and a few will have the licences. We have all 3. We raised €40M from Hedosophia, Y Combinator and Speedinvest, alongside founders and operators like Steve Anavi &amp; Alexandre Prot (Qonto), Matthieu Rouif (Photoroom), Eric Demuth (Bitpanda), Axel Weber (former UBS Chairman) and Harsh Sinha (CTO at Wise). There's never been a more exciting time to join.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>What we offer</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're 70 builders who genuinely love what they do: real ownership from day one, tier-1 salary and equity, offices in the heart of Paris with hybrid remote, and quarterly gatherings we actually look forward to.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We hire A-players who are as kind as they are demanding, people whose ideas transform not just our product but the way we work and think. Our culture is direct, transparent, and built on radical candor: we challenge each other openly, then commit. And we don't hedge on AI. It's the single most important skill of the next decade and a real bar here. Everyone at Finary has rebuilt how they work around it. If that's already second nature to you, you'll be surrounded by people pushing that frontier every day.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Read more about our values <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://finarywealth.notion.site/About-Finary-2f5919045b5d8060afd1d4e887ac550f?pvs=143">here</a>.</p><h3>The role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">The CEO Office owns Finary's most important strategic projects, the delivery of the business plan, company’s operating rituals and runs the board and investor relations. Today one Chief of Staff carries all of it. You join as a real partner: you own a share of these projects from day one and move key topics forward fast, side by side with the Chief of Staff and the CEO.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">What you will do</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take one area of the company and measurably improve its metrics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the analyses behind big decisions: business plan updates, international expansion, new offers and segments. You turn a question into a recommendation the leadership team can act on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run the board operating rhythm and the monthly reporting, with numbers you have checked yourself.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with Finance on budget, targets, forecast and costs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own Finary's operating rituals (weekly kick-off, all-hands, performance reviews, leadership topics) and make them sharper.</p></li></ul><h3>What success looks like</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>After 1 month:</strong> you know Finary's business, numbers and new vision, and you run the operating rituals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>After 3 months:</strong> you co-run the board and the monthly reporting, and the team you focus on performs measurably better.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>After 6 months:</strong> you are a multiplier across teams. The CEO Office delivers more, faster.</p></li></ul><h3>Who you are</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have a track record of winning: a competition, a sport, a project where you went further than anyone expected.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You own outcomes, not tasks. You come back with proposals, not questions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are extremely rigorous with numbers: models, Excel, data. Nothing leaves your hands unchecked.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You write short, clear English that a board member reads in 5 minutes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are an AI pioneer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You build trust fast and get things done through people, without authority.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are discreet and put the company first.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are in your final year or a recent graduate of a top business or engineering school, fluent in French and English.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus:</strong> a first internship in strategy consulting, ideally followed by startup ops or product. Being a Finary user.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>Practical details</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6-month end-of-studies internship or graduate program, starting January 2027.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Onsite in Paris, every day, with the CEO Office.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Process: application review, screening call, case study with a debrief with the Chief of Staff and the CEO, then a culture fit interview.</p></li></ul><hr><p>Compensation: €1.8K – €2K per month</p><ul><li> • Internship - CEO Office €1.8K – €2K per month</li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/finary/chief-of-staff-intern-paris-416936","tags":["Founding Team"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1794022830},{"slug":"scriptwriter-intern-paris-146650","company_name":"Finary","title":"Scriptwriter intern","description":"<h1><strong>La mission de Finary</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notre mission : rendre le pouvoir aux investisseurs. Le bon conseil financier a toujours existé, mais il était réservé à ceux qui dépassaient un certain seuil de patrimoine. Nous changeons la donne en construisant la plateforme d'investissement tout-en-un, propulsée par l'IA : suivre ses actifs, gérer son budget, investir et se former, au même endroit. Une idée simple et ambitieuse nous guide : mettre un banquier privé dans la poche de chacun.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mounirlaggoune">Mounir</a> a lancé Finary en 2021, et plus d'un million de personnes nous confient aujourd'hui leur vie financière. Nous lançons des produits de pointe avec une touche de plaisir, et nous sommes exigeants sur l'expérience, la performance et la simplicité.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Pourquoi maintenant ?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une nouvelle génération d'investisseurs émerge : ambitieuse, impliquée, débarrassée des tabous autour de l'argent. Nous croyons en un monde où investir permet à chacun de vivre la vie dont il a toujours rêvé. Pour accélérer, nous avons levé 40M€ auprès de Hedosophia, Y Combinator et Speedinvest, aux côtés de fondateurs et d'opérateurs comme Steve Anavi et Alexandre Prot (Qonto), Matthieu Rouif (Photoroom), Eric Demuth (Bitpanda), Axel Weber (ancien président d'UBS) et Harsh Sinha (CTO de Wise).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">En juillet 2026, l'AMF nous a accordé l'agrément MiCA, qui s'ajoute à notre agrément d'Entreprise d'Investissement : nous sommes l'une des très rares plateformes françaises à détenir les deux, avec actions, ETF et crypto réunis sur une seule plateforme régulée, au moment même où l'Europe se consolide autour des acteurs agréés. Il n'y a jamais eu de meilleur moment pour nous rejoindre.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Ce que nous offrons</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nous sommes 70 builders qui aimons profondément ce que nous faisons : de vraies responsabilités dès le premier jour, un package salaire et equity au meilleur niveau du marché, des bureaux en plein cœur de Paris avec du remote hybride, et des offsites trimestriels qu'on attend vraiment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nous recrutons des A-players aussi bienveillants qu'exigeants, des personnes dont les idées transforment notre produit autant que notre façon de travailler et de penser. Notre culture est directe et transparente : on se challenge ouvertement, puis on s'aligne et on exécute. Et sur l'IA, pas de demi-mesure : c'est la compétence la plus importante de la décennie et un vrai critère chez nous. Chacun a repensé sa manière de travailler autour d'elle. Si c'est déjà une seconde nature pour vous, vous trouverez ici des gens qui repoussent cette frontière chaque jour.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Découvrez nos valeurs <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://app.notion.com/p/About-Finary-2f5919045b5d8060afd1d4e887ac550f?pvs=21">ici</a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">---</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>LE POSTE</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Finary Media fait la première chaîne YouTube d’éducation financière en France : 880 000 abonnés et 5 à 10 millions de vues par mois, tout est produit en interne. Chaque vidéo est traitée comme un produit : on mesure, on itère, on améliore.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rattaché·e à <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/rayan-d-4455b4265">Rayan</a>, tu travailles sur l’ensemble de la chaîne d’écriture : recherche, script, vérification, packaging et présentation face caméra.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>TES MISSIONS</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mener la recherche sur des sujets d’investissement et de patrimoine (ETF, assurance-vie, immobilier, fiscalité), à partir de sources fiables, et vérifier chaque donnée.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rédiger des scripts pour la chaîne YouTube et les formats courts, puis les faire évoluer avec l’auteur senior jusqu’à la version validée.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Présenter tes scripts face caméra.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Concevoir le packaging des vidéos : titres, accroches, angles de miniature.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intégrer l’IA à chaque étape de la production et développer tes propres outils : prompts structurés, workflows, automatisations.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>CE QUE CE STAGE T’APPORTE</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Écrire pour une audience de plusieurs centaines de milliers de personnes, avec des résultats mesurés sur chaque vidéo.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une formation à la présentation face caméra, au sein d’une équipe qui tourne chaque semaine.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">La rigueur d’une rédaction financière, où aucune approximation n’est acceptée.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une méthode de production où l’IA prend en charge une grande partie de la recherche et de la mise en forme.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>PROFIL RECHERCHÉ</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Étudiant·e en Bac+4 ou Bac+5 en école de journalisme, en école de commerce ou en master de finance ou d’économie, avec une convention de stage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une solide culture financière : tu maîtrises les fondamentaux de l’épargne et de l’investissement (enveloppes fiscales, classes d’actifs, fiscalité du patrimoine) et tu sais les rendre accessibles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une plume démontrée : des textes publiés que tu peux nous montrer (média étudiant, blog, newsletter, LinkedIn, rédaction en stage). Nous évaluons la qualité de l’écriture et ta capacité à retenir le lecteur.</p>