 to understand requirements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist with maintaining technical documentation and sharing knowledge.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Explore different technologies and gradually build your skills across the software development lifecycle.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will join an agile <strong>"build it and run it"</strong> environment, where teams take part in building, launching, monitoring and improving the products and services they own. Your level of responsibility will grow throughout the internship, with regular guidance and feedback from your team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>OUR TECH ENVIRONMENT 💻</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The technologies you use will depend on the team you join. Our engineering environment may include:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Backend:</strong> Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Celery, Golang and Django</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Frontend:</strong> Vue.js, TypeScript, Nuxt and Revolve, our design system</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data and messaging:</strong> PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka, RabbitMQ and BigQuery</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Infrastructure and delivery:</strong> Google Cloud Platform, Kubernetes, Docker, Datadog, Argo CD, CircleCI and GitHub</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">You do not need experience with all of these technologies. We are more interested in your technical foundations, curiosity and willingness to learn.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>YOU ARE IN THE RIGHT PLACE IF: ⭐</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mandatory! Currently enrolled in your final year of an Engineering School/University Master's degree and your university can provide an internship agreement - already based in France</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have knowledge 