ence with medium-voltage converter systems or solid-state transformers.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Knowledge of data center power architectures.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in design for manufacturing and cost engineering.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience establishing systems engineering processes in a growing organization.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Benefits</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Equity + competitive salary.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unique technology and market opportunity – shape the architecture of a new product category for the energy transition.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid work with flexible working times.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/hyperscale-power/system-architect-zurich-244383","tags":["Research & Development"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1794033630},{"slug":"business-risk-analyst-trading-desks-bank-zurich-148970","company_name":"coni+partner AG","title":"Business Risk Analyst Trading Desks Bank","description":"<p></p><p>coni + partner, established 1993, is a consultancy company with headquarters in Zurich and subsidiaries in Düsseldorf and Shanghai. We are specialised in custom-fit staffing in tune with the corporate culture by ensuring a perfect match of professional skills, references and personal as well as social skills of successful candidates.</p><p>Our client is an international bank in Zurich. We are looking for a trading process specialist (m, f, d) as </p><p><strong>Business Risk Analyst Trading Desks Bank</strong></p><p>Your Tasks: </p><p>Conducting analyses of