&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Delivery Transformation Director&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the successful execution and growth of large-scale transformation programs. The ideal candidate is a hands-on leader with a proven track record of delivering complex, large-scale projects at top-tier consulting firms. This is a unique opportunity to own the end-to-end delivery of our most strategic client engagements whilst shaping and expanding our solution and delivery capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the planning, execution, and delivery of complex transformation programs. Ensure projects are delivered on time, within budget, and to the highest quality standards, exceeding client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Relationship Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain strong, trusted relationships with C-level executives and key client stakeholders. Serve as the primary point of contact for all program-related matters and proactively manage risks and issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership and Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide mentorship and guidance to project teams, fostering a culture of excellence and accountability. Oversee resource allocation, project timelines, and budget management across multiple engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and pursue opportunities for program expansion and new business within existing accounts. Partner with the sales and solution teams to contribute to proposals, statements of work, and go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of total professional experience, including 8+ years leading complex project delivery within a management consultancy, technology consulting firm, or digital engineering services company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in &lt;strong&gt;leading&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;delivering&lt;/strong&gt; multi-million-dollar, multi-year &lt;strong&gt;digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;programs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in &lt;strong&gt;managing fixed price and outcome based deliveries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional &lt;strong&gt;communication&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;presentation&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;skills&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to articulate complex &lt;strong&gt;technical concepts&lt;/strong&gt; to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;business&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;acumen&lt;/strong&gt; and a track record of driving &lt;strong&gt;business&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German&lt;/strong&gt; (B2/C1) required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Work Modality&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid (with up to 40% client-site travel)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/thoughtworks/delivery-transformation-director-amsterdam-363429","tags":["1L_TWNET PS - Solution & Delivery"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1794023717},{"slug":"senior-engineer-i-total-product-support-370673","company_name":"Asm","title":"Senior Engineer I, Total Product Support","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job’s mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineer, Total Product Support&lt;/strong&gt; at ASM, you will take ownership of highly visible technical projects and drive them from planning through execution and delivery. Acting as the central point connecting engineering teams, operations, and customers, you will ensure that technical solutions are developed, tested, implemented, and supported successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with a strong engineering foundation who enjoys bringing people together, solving problems, and turning technical requirements into clear actions. You do not need to be the subject matter expert in every technical area, but you should be comfortable working with engineers, understanding complex technical concepts, asking the right questions, and keeping projects moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will be working on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate technical projects from initial planning through execution, customer delivery, and program close-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop execution plans, define priorities, coordinate resources, and ensure key project milestones and deliverables are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point of coordination between engineering teams, technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the build and qualification phase of technical solutions, including coordinating in-house testing, additional test equipment, technical evaluations, and readiness for customer implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineers to understand technical challenges, determine where additional expertise or consultation is required, and drive issues toward resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate directly with customers to understand requirements, provide transparent project updates, and support successful technical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project progress, identify risks and roadblocks early, and communicate openly when plans, deliverables, or timelines are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze project and test outcomes, coordinate follow-up activities, and ensure programs are properly completed and transitioned into customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer operational activities across multiple stakeholders while maintaining accountability for overall project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear and concise reporting on high-visibility projects to stakeholders and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Physics, Materials Science&lt;/strong&gt;, or another relevant technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid engineering foundation and the ability to understand and communicate technical concepts across different engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project coordination skills with the ability to plan, organize, and drive activities from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, including the confidence to work with engineers, managers, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability, with a proactive and hands-on approach to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify risks, communicate challenges transparently, and escalate issues when necessary rather than waiting for problems to resolve themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new technologies, processes, and technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, adaptability, and a strong “can-do” mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in semiconductor equipment, high-tech manufacturing, mechanical/electrical systems, or another complex engineering environment (not required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating multidisciplinary teams and translating between technical specialists, operations, management, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Relevant professional, internship, research, or project experience demonstrating the ability to coordinate technical work and drive execution is an advantage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and the confidence to challenge assumptions, raise concerns, and create alignment across different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to project execution combined with the flexibility to adapt when technical priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking accountability for highly visible projects where clear and timely communication is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally, typically &lt;strong&gt;1–2 times per year&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on project and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/asm/senior-engineer-i-total-product-support-370673","tags":["SU3.Metal Dep- VF KPU"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794023715},{"slug":"head-of-marketplaces-netherlands-170884","company_name":"Onhires","title":"Head of Marketplaces","description":"<h2>About the company</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for a <strong>Head of Marketplaces</strong> for our client, a <strong>DTC jewelry brand</strong> behind <strong>waterproof, tarnish-proof jewelry</strong> made to be worn every day.<br /></p><h2>The role in short</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll <strong>set up and own the brand's marketplace channel</strong>, starting with Amazon US and expanding to key regional marketplaces, with full ownership of <strong>P&amp;L and growth</strong>.<br /></p><h2>What you'll do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own P&amp;L and growth</strong> on Amazon US first, then across key regional marketplaces</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build and execute the marketplace roadmap:</strong> listings, content, ads, promotions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive ranking, rating and review strategy</strong> across platforms</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead marketplace ad spend</strong>, bidding and performance analytics</p></li></ul><h2>What we're looking for</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>5+ years scaling consumer brands on Amazon</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Recent hands-on experience growing brands on Amazon US</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deep command of marketplace SEO, ads and algorithmic levers</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Proven P&amp;L ownership</strong> on a 7- or 8-figure marketplace channel</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sharp analytical skills:</strong> comfortable in the data and in the detail</p></li></ul><h2>Nice to have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience launching marketplace channels in new regions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dutch language skills</p></li></ul><h2>Location &amp; format</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Europe</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fully remote</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>B2B contract</strong></p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/onhires/head-of-marketplaces-netherlands-170884","tags":["Sales/marketing"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1794022824},{"slug":"software-lead-engineer-nts-eindhoven-291937","company_name":"NTS","title":"Software Lead Engineer | NTS Eindhoven","description":"<p>At NTS, we make it possible together. Technology inspires and drives us; it is our passion. Every day we work on unique solutions to complex challenges. Whether it's ultra-complex or ultra-precise solutions, we are proud of what we do and what we deliver.</p><p>Want to set the technical direction of complex software projects and guide engineering teams towards reliable, high-quality solutions? Are you passionate about software development and high-tech product development, and do you enjoy combining technical expertise with technical leadership? Then get started as <strong>Software Lead Engineer</strong> at <strong>NTS Eindhoven</strong> and let's make it possible together.<br></p><h3><strong>Job Description</strong></h3><p>As Software Lead Engineer/ Technical Lead at NTS Eindhoven, you set the technical direction for our software projects and coordinate the technical work of the engineers assigned to them. Working in collaborative teams of fewer than ten colleagues, you translate project objectives and complex requirements into software architecture, design decisions and executable technical plans.</p><p>This is a technical leadership role without line-management responsibility. You lead through technical direction, coordination and coaching, while the Group Lead or Competence Manager remains responsible for people management.</p><p>Our teams develop qualification tools, semiconductor equipment, defence and healthcare systems, and other advanced technology solutions. You collaborate closely with software, mechanical, electrical and mechatronics engineers to deliver integrated system solutions that meet high quality standards.</p><p>We value clear and transparent communication. You proactively identify technical risks and roadblocks, support the team in resolving challenges and ensure that solutions are delivered in line with project objectives.</p><h3><strong>Furthermore, your key responsibilities are:</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Lead the technical side of software projects, including architecture, design and technical decision-making;</p></li><li><p>Coordinate the technical work of engineers allocated to your projects and ensure alignment with project plans;</p></li><li><p>Provide accurate technical estimates and planning input to project managers;</p></li><li><p>Safeguard software quality by promoting best practices, code reviews and effective test strategies;</p></li><li><p>Identify technical risks and roadblocks early and define and implement mitigation actions;</p></li><li><p>Coach and support colleagues technically, encourage knowledge sharing and contribute to continuous improvement;</p></li><li><p>Stay close to the code and contribute hands-on whenever required.<br></p></li></ul><h3><strong>Job Requirements</strong></h3><p>To be successful in this role, you bring a strong combination of technical expertise, leadership capabilities and interpersonal skills. You recognise yourself in the following profile:</p><ul><li><p>Bachelor's degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science or a related technical field;</p></li><li><p>Minimum 8 years of experience in developing technical software using C#, .NET/.NET Framework or C++ (knowledge of C is a plus);</p></li><li><p>Proven experience in setting technical direction, coordinating engineering activities and guiding other software engineers, with or without formal line-management responsibility;</p></li><li><p>Experience in UI development, for example WPF, and a strong understanding of OOP principles and UML design;</p></li><li><p>Experience working in an Agile development environment and with Azure DevOps or similar platforms;</p></li><li><p>Experience in a high-tech mechatronic environment is a strong advantage;</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of one or more of the following areas is a plus: databases, DevOps, test strategy, electronics or mechatronics, and computer vision;</p></li><li><p>Excellent communication and social skills, with the ability to explain complex technical topics in an understandable way;</p></li><li><p>Proficient in English, both written and spoken. Knowledge of Dutch is a plus;</p></li><li><p>A proactive team player with a strong willingness to learn, develop and collaborate in the fast-evolving high-tech industry.<br></p></li></ul><h4><strong>Your terms of employment</strong></h4><p>At NTS, we combine our passion for technology with innovative solutions to complex challenges. You get the freedom and confidence to fully use and develop your talents in a dynamic and energetic environment. We invest both in technology and in you as a future colleague!</p><p>With this challenge, we offer the following terms of employment:</p><ul><li><p>Competitive salary;</p></li><li><p>A position at NTS Eindhoven, with a working week of at least 32 hours;</p></li><li><p>Personal growth and development opportunities, for example through training and/or education;</p></li><li><p>27 vacation days and an additional 13 ADV days;</p></li><li><p>Excellent pension plan with PME;</p></li><li><p>Travel expense allowance paid monthly, with a maximum of 50 km per single journey and an allowance of €0.21 per km;<br></p></li></ul><h4><strong>About NTS</strong></h4><p>We deliver unique solutions to complex challenges and drive technological advancement for our customers. By combining development, manufacturing and assembly, we play an integral role in bringing the supply chain together. We combine the best skills and brightest ideas into a working system for the world's most advanced Semiconductor, Opto-Mechatronics and Analytical solutions. For this reason, we have grown into a Tier-1 supplier to OEMs and an international player operating from various (production) sites in Europe, Asia and the US.</p><p>Although we offer our teams around the world a great place to work, we do not forget to remain firmly rooted locally. Ultimately, the core of NTS is our people. Their excellent manufacturing skills, customer-focused mindset and clear technical solutions have made NTS what it is today. Together, we create a culture that everyone can be proud of because we make it possible together. That's why we take every opportunity to celebrate our people, our craftsmanship and our successes.<br></p><h2><strong>Interested?</strong></h2><p>Apply immediately and send your CV (and motivation letter) via the application button below! For more information about this vacancy or our organization, please contact our Recruitment Business Partner at <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nts/software-lead-engineer-nts-eindhoven-291937","tags":["NTS Eindhoven - Advanced Technologies"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Eindhoven, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands","created_at":1794022296},{"slug":"junior-ai-consultant-utrecht-183828","company_name":"IG&H","title":"Junior AI consultant","description":"<p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Locatie:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Utrecht | </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">Dienstverband:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Vast | </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">Uren:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> 32–40 uur per week</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Ben jij analytisch sterk en lijkt het je interessant om met AI écht impact te maken bij verschillende organisaties? Wil je werken aan projecten waarin strategie, technologie en AI samenkomen? Dan is een carrière als junior AI consultant bij IG&amp;H iets voor jou.</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">Bij IG&amp;H start je als </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">Junior AI Consultant</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> binnen ons Data &amp; AI-team, onderdeel van onze consultancypraktijk. Dat betekent dat je niet alleen met technologie werkt, maar ook met klanten — van boardroom tot operations. Je leert hoe je AI-oplossingen vertaalt naar concrete toepassingen die organisaties slimmer, efficiënter en innovatiever maken.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Over de werkzaamheden:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je helpt klanten in retail, financiële dienstverlening en gezondheidszorg om hun data door middel van AI succesvol in te zetten;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je combineert machine learning, datamodellering en AI met strategisch inzicht;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je vertaalt businessvraagstukken naar praktische AI-oplossingen;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je werkt in multidisciplinaire teams samen met collega-consultants, data scientists en engineers;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je presenteert je inzichten en aanbevelingen op een heldere en overtuigende manier aan klanten;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je ondersteunt organisaties bij AI-adoptie en het realiseren van duurzame verandering;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je leert continu bij via training, coaching en uitdagende projecten.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#121317">Kortom: je bouwt niet alleen kennis op van AI en data, maar ontwikkelt ook de adviesvaardigheden die je carrière in de consultancy versnellen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Over het team</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Wij helpen onze klanten innoveren en gebruikmaken van de nieuwste data- en AI-technologie. Ons Data &amp; AI-team bestaat uit ruim 40 data-experts, waaronder Data Scientists, Data Engineers en AI-consultants. Samen realiseren zij innovatieve data-, analytics- en AI-oplossingen voor klanten in Retail, Financial Services en Health. Het team groeit snel en heeft de ambitie om verder uit te bouwen tot een van de meest toonaangevende Data &amp; AI-praktijken van Nederland. Die groei komt voort uit ons succes: klanten kiezen steeds vaker voor IG&amp;H vanwege onze combinatie van strategisch inzicht, technische expertise en pragmatische executie. We werken aan projecten die direct bijdragen aan betere besluitvorming, efficiëntere processen en nieuwe businessmodellen. Voor professionals die impact willen maken is dit een omgeving waar ondernemerschap, innovatie en persoonlijke ontwikkeling centraal staan. Hier bouw je niet alleen mee aan de toekomst van onze klanten, maar ook aan de verdere groei van het Data &amp; AI-team zelf.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Wat jij meebrengt:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Een masterdiploma (WO-niveau) in Artificial Intelligence, Econometrie of Data Science of een vergelijkbare richting;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ervaring via een stage of werkstudentschap;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Vaardigheid in Python en/of R;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Sterke analytische en communicatieve vaardigheden (Nederlands &amp; Engels);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Interesse in consultancy, technologie en AI;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Nieuwsgierigheid, leergierigheid en een proactieve houding.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Wat wij jou bieden</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Coaching on the job door ervaren consultants;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je start vanaf </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">januari 2026</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Een uitgebreid ontwikkelprogramma via de IG&amp;H Academy;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Een uitstekend salaris, bonusregeling en mobiliteitsregeling of bedrijfsauto;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">25 vakantiedagen + tot 5 extra bij te kopen;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Healthy Human-programma voor jouw welzijn en balans;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Sabbatical na 3 jaar dienstverband;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We zijn een </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">Great Place To Work</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> (NPS &gt; 60), en investeren in jouw ontwikkeling vanaf dag één;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Flexibiliteit: werken kan ook 32 uur per week (minimaal 4 dagen);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Veel plezier met een jong, ambitieus en sociaal team.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW250470269 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Waarom IG&amp;H?</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW250470269 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">IG&amp;H transformeert toonaangevende bedrijven in de gezondheidszorg, retail en financiële sectoren. Samen met onze wereldklasse technologiepartners helpen we onze klanten vooruit te komen en relevant te blijven, met inzichtelijk advies, geweldig ontwerp en ongeëvenaarde digitale platforms. Onze uitzonderlijke resultaten komen voort uit het succesvol afstemmen van mensen, bedrijfsvoering en technologie. Met meer dan 650 getalenteerde collega’s aan boord, mensen die veranderingen en uitdagingen echt omarmen, hebben we een unieke cultuur gecreëerd die zowel </span><em><span style="color:#121317">hoog durft als hoog zorgt</span></em><span style="color:#121317">. We trekken buitengewone mensen aan en inspireren hen om de grenzen te verleggen voor zichzelf en onze klanten.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Interesse?</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Klaar om je carrière als AI consultant bij ons te starten? Dan maken we graag kennis met je. Voor meer informatie kun