<li>Active maintenance of Bazel open-source tools.</li>
<li>Expertise in Bazel performance optimization, both within rules and in evaluating the build graph.</li>
<li>Knowledge of other reproducible build systems, such as Nix, Buck2, or Pants.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="careers-detail__group">
