&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our central Talent Acquisition team operating across our hubs in Europe. We are a fast-moving, collaborative team dedicated to scaling Stark Defence by bringing elite talent into our engineering, software, and operational functions. In this role, you will work closely with TA Partners during a critical phase of recruitment system modernization and process optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Working Student in Recruitment Support, you will play a key role in driving our recruitment tools migration and system optimization. You will ensure seamless data accuracy, support initial candidate application workflows, and help maintain precise talent documentation across our recruitment platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the migration of active and archived recruitment data between ATSs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review incoming job applications and classify candidate profiles according to standardized talent tags and role criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate candidate records, compliance documentation, and talent pipeline tags in line with GDPR standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist TA Partners with auditing job descriptions, maintaining high quality standards across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Talent Acquisition Partners to ensure swift data processing and resolve minor ATS workflow bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and initiate background and security verification checks for candidates in line with defence industry requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled student in Business Administration, Human Resources, Psychology, Business Informatics, or a related field in Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
