rvices are critical and supporting the successful roll out </p></li></ul><h2><strong>Who we think we be successful in this role</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record closing complex, high-value deals (six figures and above), ideally in a solution-sale or enterprise environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong self-starter with genuine experience generating your own pipeline and not just working inbound leads.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable and effective with SDR-style outreach: cold email, LinkedIn, calling and event-based prospecting.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling into large enterprise or matrixed organisations, ideally med-tech, med-device, pharma, healthcare, or another regulated/technical market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A creative, hypothesis-driven approach to sales - someone who tests new angles rather than defaulting to "how it's always been done."</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence operating without a fully mature playbook, and the drive to help build one.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working with data and CRM reporting to justify targeting decisions, track what's working, and adjust cadence and channel mix based on results rather than instinct alone.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent stakeholder management across clinical, procurement, and commercial buyers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience driving smart adoption of available tools using agentic AI for persona and target company research, for example, delivering results faster and at greater scale.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What We Offer</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Private healthcare with AXA for you and your family </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A penthouse office in Farringdon with unlimited snacks and soft drinks</p></li><li><p style="min-heigh