g the answers into improvements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Happy getting into the detail of a problem, across systems and teams, to find out what actually went wrong.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity about how tools, automation and AI could make the team’s work easier.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clear, calm writing, even when a customer isn’t, and confidence on the phone with an unhappy client.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nice to have:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Zendesk or a similar helpdesk tool.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in parking, mobility, utilities or another high-volume consumer service.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience setting up weekend cover.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Don’t be put off</strong> if you haven’t built helpdesk reports yourself. What matters is that you’ve set targets, held a team to them, and used the numbers to make things better. We’ll help you with the tools.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What We Offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid working: 3 days in the office, 2 days from home.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Room to grow with the business, with training and development support.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">20 days’ annual leave plus bank holidays.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Company pension scheme.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A fully refurbished, modern office right next to East Croydon Station, with a fully stocked kitchen offering free breakfast, lunch and drinks (and two office dogs!).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Laptop and tech provided.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Employee Assistance Programme, BrightHR Exchange discounts and regular company events.</p></li></ul><p style="min-heigh