&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THG Commerce: A cloud-native technology stack enabling retailers and brands to create intelligent, AI-powered, digital shopping experiences, while integrated marketplace and social commerce functionality allows brands to reach customers across every sales channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With its expertise in building and scaling brands, THG Ingenuity is uniquely positioned to bring pertinent, pragmatic, and global know-how across all aspects of commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Junior People Data Analyst to support accurate, timely and insightful people reporting across the organisation. This is an excellent opportunity to develop your skills in data analysis, HR systems, reporting and process improvement while working closely with stakeholders across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for data, reporting and HRIS queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce accurate scheduled and ad-hoc reports for stakeholders across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract, clean and transform data from multiple sources to prepare it for analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refresh and quality-check dashboards to ensure information remains current and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse people data, highlighting relevant insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular data audits to identify and resolve inaccuracies in people systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support automation and process-improvement initiatives that reduce manual administration across the People Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Essential skills and experience&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be inquisitive and demonstrate a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise multiple tasks and manage competing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of Microsoft Excel, including formulas (VLOOKUP’s etc.) and data manipulation. Experience with Power Query, PivotTables or dashboard reporting would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to exercise discretion and maintain a high level of confidentiality when handling sensitive information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build effective working relationships with key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Desirable skills and experience&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Power BI or a similar reporting or visualisation tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of automation capabilities, such as Power Automate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to support Excel analysis, reporting or basic coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
