&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do you thrive on shaping the strategic technological future of the world’s leading brands? Are you a visionary architect who can orchestrate complex&amp;nbsp;MarTech&amp;nbsp;ecosystems to deliver&amp;nbsp;hyper-personalised&amp;nbsp;customer experiences at scale? Can you translate ambitious business&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;into scalable, compliant, and future-proof enterprise architectures?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you are a strategic technology leader with a consultancy mindset, strong stakeholder management skills, and a passion for driving innovation across enterprise&amp;nbsp;MarTech&amp;nbsp;landscapes, then you might be the Enterprise Architect&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;looking for.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
